※ pl4g-test: compile=error
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4624 LANG_ANSWER_CANNOT_BE_COPIED

※ An answer made somewhere its signature does not name is copied, and some values cannot be
※ copied yet: a record holding text is one, what its fields point into wanting a walk of its own.
※ A value holding something marked `@[unique]` never can.

type Named = name: str

fn made(first: str) → Named:
    let scratch: mut arena = ⎕arena
    defer ⎕empty(scratch)
    Named(.name ← first ⧺ "!" in scratch)

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    if made("a").name = "a!": 0u6 else: 1u6
